<aside class="affiliate-box" id="online-notarization">
  <p class="eyebrow">Advertisement · Affiliate disclosure</p>
  <h2>Need it notarized tonight, from wherever you are?</h2>
  <p>If a receiving party accepts <strong>remote online notarization (RON)</strong>, a session with {{ site.ron.name }} can be a fallback when no local notary can reach you in time. New York allows RON, but some courts, banks, and foreign authorities still want a wet-ink, in-person seal — confirm first.</p>
  <p class="disclosure">{{ site.ron.disclosure }}</p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="{{ site.ron.url }}" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Start with {{ site.ron.name }}</a>
  </p>
  {% if site.ron.affiliatePlaceholder %}
  <p class="muted small">This button currently points to the public {{ site.ron.name }} website, not a tracked affiliate link.</p>
  {% endif %}
</aside>
